{"slug":"Stud-Long-Jumps-Obby-Go-through-all-levels-and-Auto-Rebirth-27945","_id":"679b0eeb3c4c3155ee176317","title":"Go through all levels and Auto Rebirth","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c784ae","gameId":12062249395,"name":"Stud Long Jumps Obby","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":12062249395},"features":"Simple Script to teleport you through all the stages and get a automatic rebirth.\n\nJust edit the \"LoopFor\" number if you wanna go through more times :p","tags":[],"script":"local Checkpoints = game:GetService(\"Workspace\"):WaitForChild(\"Checkpoints\")\nlocal CheckpointNum = #Checkpoints:GetChildren()\n\nlocal player = game.Players.LocalPlayer\nlocal Char = player.Character\nlocal HRP = Char.HumanoidRootPart\n\n--- \n\n\nlocal LoopFor = 50 -- Change this to however many times you want to go through.\n\n\n----\n\n\n-- Below this is the script, don't edit unless you know what you're doing.\n\n\nfor i = 0, LoopFor, 1 do\n\n\nfor i = 0, CheckpointNum, 1 do\nwait()\nif i ~= 52 then\nHRP.CFrame = Checkpoints[i].CFrame\nelse\ngame:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\"):WaitForChild(\"RebirthEvent\"):FireServer()\nend\nprint(i)\nend\n\nend","owner":{"_id":"61eb02b5ab391bb2c3d9db10","username":"dullsoulss","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/569f77030471b95973e8ca3e4d3ad3aa1cf9cd117d5e3572cdf713794f2f17a7.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61eb02b5ab391bb2c3d9db10-1738214960890.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"61eb02b5ab391bb2c3d9db10","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/569f77030471b95973e8ca3e4d3ad3aa1cf9cd117d5e3572cdf713794f2f17a7.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/61eb02b5ab391bb2c3d9db10-1738214960890.jpg"}},"verified":false,"keyLink":"","views":4302,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatche